  message: "Done in PR #3475 (joint with WI-zisit-hagud). New module hypergumbo_core.axis_drift provides field-agnostic find_drift(repo_root, *, name_filter, registry_names, search_roots=..., excluded_path_substrings=...). edge_types.find_axis_drift becomes a thin Edge-type wrapper preserving the existing single-argument signature. ADR-0024 §Enforcement updated with the one-call-site pattern future axes follow. 18 new tests in test_axis_drift.py exercise the parameterization (synthetic registry, multi-root scope, custom roots/exclusions, missing-root handling, AST-walk edge cases). Both modules at 100% coverage in package isolation."  # ea17
